  data:
    Id: frostbite
    DisplayName: Frostbite
    Description: 'A lucky strike leaves the target chilled to the bone. Elemental
      family: Ice, the chill-proc half -- Frosty carries the on-hit damage and Permafrost
      carries the resistance; this used to ride along with both on one bundled Frosty
      roll, now it is its own affix.'
